OL,5,G2000 Wallis Simpson: Marriage & Exile
OL,6,     FThe untold story of Wallis
OL,7,     FSimpson, Duchess of Windsor,
OL,8,     Ffollowing Edward VIII's death.
OL,9,     FIncreasingly vulnerable, she falls
OL,10,     Funder the influence of formidable
OL,11,     Flawyer Suzanne Blum.
OL,12,G2100 Wallis Simpson: The Final Days
OL,13,     FWhen Wallis Simpson's health
OL,14,     Fdeclines, lawyer Suzanne Blum
OL,15,     Fisolates the Duchess from friends
OL,16,     Fand advisers. As fortunes vanish,
OL,17,     Fquestions grow over her final
OL,18,     Fyears and lost wealth.
